    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Role in cor pulmonale:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " tx is directed at the cause; acute causes incl massive pulmonary embolization. When the cause is acute PE: initial, then maintenance anticoagulation is indicated (prevents further embolization and new clot); dabigatran is effective for acute DVT and PE; as initial tx it needs overlap w a parenteral anticoagulant."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Interactions:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " ⍉P-gp inducers (eg, RIF), which lower dabigatran levels;"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Counseling:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " swallow capsules whole w a full glass of H2O; breaking, chewing or emptying them raises exposure. Don't stop early: premature discontinuation raises thrombotic risk."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Reversal for emergency surg or urgent procedures: idarucizumab 5 g IV (two 2.5 g vials)."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
